  "code": "class Solution:\n    def rightSideView(self, root):\n        # 先说明变量含义，再完成你的实现\n        ans=[]\n        def dfs(node,depth):\n            if node is None:\n                return None\n            # 如果这一层还没有节点，就记录当前节点\n            if depth == len(ans):\n                ans.append(node.val)\n\n            dfs(node.right,depth+1)\n            dfs(node.left,depth+1)\n            \n        dfs(root,0)\n\n        return ans\n",
